        "## Part 4: Double Machine Learning\n",
        "\n",
        "This manually implements partialling-out DML:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Predict the outcome using controls.\n",
        "2. Predict treatment probability using controls.\n",
        "3. Residualize outcome and treatment.\n",
        "4. Regress residualized outcome on residualized treatment."
